00:01:25,730 --> 00:01:27,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><font color="#fff4f2">mou ikkai</font></font></font></b></font>

30
00:01:25,730 --> 00:01:27,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><font color="#fff4f2">one more time</font></font></font></b></font>

31
00:01:31,730 --> 00:01:32,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura!</font>

32
00:01:33,860 --> 00:01:36,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was worth teaching you Genjutsu
in survival training</font>

33
00:01:36,530 --> 00:01:38,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">during the Genin Exam.</font>

34
00:01:39,240 --> 00:01:41,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You truly have a talent for it.</font>

35
00:01:42,490 --> 00:01:43,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

36
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:47,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Release the Genjutsu and
wake up Naruto and Shikamaru!</font>

37
00:01:48,170 --> 00:01:50,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto will be delighted.</font>

38
00:01:51,340 --> 00:01:52,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He'll be getting a mission
after such a long while.</font>

39
00:01:54,210 --> 00:01:55,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean by a mission?</font>

40
00:01:56,090 --> 00:01:57,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be careful...</font>

41
00:01:59,050 --> 00:02:02,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the first A-Ranked mission
since the Land of the Waves.</font>

42
00:02:02,430 --> 00:02:09,400
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">I've Been Waiting</font>

43
00:02:02,430 --> 00:02:09,400
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">For</font>

44
00:02:02,430 --> 00:02:09,400
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">This!</font>

45
00:02:02,430 --> 00:02:09,400
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5"><font size="50">It's an A-Rank Mission!!</font></font>

46
00:02:13,320 --> 00:02:16,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sensei! What do you mean by A-Ranked
mission in the condition we are in?!</font>

47
00:02:16,860 --> 00:02:18,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do we have to do?!</font>

48
00:02:19,410 --> 00:02:21,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke is chasing Gaara and company
of the Sand Village.</font>

49
00:02:23,620 --> 00:02:24,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura...</font>

50
00:02:25,080 --> 00:02:27,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Release the Genjutsu
on Naruto and Shikamaru,</font>

51
00:02:28,160 --> 00:02:29,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and go after Sasuke.</font>

52
00:02:33,920 --> 00:02:37,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I feel uneasy...
about that unusual Chakra.</font>

53
00:02:46,140 --> 00:02:47,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But then,</font>

54
00:02:47,560 --> 00:02:49,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we should wake up Ino and Choji
and go in a large group.</font>

55
00:02:50,440 --> 00:02:53,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There may already
be quite a large number</font>

56
00:02:53,190 --> 00:02:55,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">of Sand and Sound Shinobi
who have infiltrated this village.</font>

57
00:02:57,990 --> 00:03:02,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Actions lose quickness when there's more
than the fundamental four in a squad...</font>

58
00:03:02,240 --> 00:03:04,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and it becomes difficult to
hide from the enemy.</font>

59
00:03:06,700 --> 00:03:09,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You learned that in the Academy's
patrol practical training, right?</font>

60
00:03:11,080 --> 00:03:15,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, I see! Then four means
that you'll come with us...</font>

61
00:03:15,880 --> 00:03:18,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, I must not leave here.</font>

62
00:03:19,470 --> 00:03:20,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Summoning Jutsu!</font>

63
00:03:26,810 --> 00:03:30,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As for the rest, this Pakkun will
track down Sasuke by scent!</font>

64
00:03:32,100 --> 00:03:35,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">C-Could it be...
the one other member is this puppy?!</font>

65
00:03:38,230 --> 00:03:43,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Little girl!
Don't you be calling me a cute puppy!</font>

66
00:03:44,490 --> 00:03:46,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't say... cute.</font>

67
00:03:47,660 --> 00:03:51,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, Sakura! Release the Genjutsu
on Naruto and Shikamaru!</font>

68
00:03:51,910 --> 00:03:52,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

69
00:04:08,390 --> 00:04:09,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Release!</font>

70
00:04:17,860 --> 00:04:19,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it... Sakura-chan?</font>

71
00:04:20,860 --> 00:04:21,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get down!</font>

72
00:04:23,150 --> 00:04:25,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll tell you later!
Just stay down!</font>

73
00:04:33,290 --> 00:04:36,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru... you were...
from the beginning...</font>

74
00:04:41,550 --> 00:04:43,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ouch!</font>

75
00:04:43,630 --> 00:04:46,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You were able to release Genjutsu, too!</font>

76
00:04:46,260 --> 00:04:48,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why were you pretending
to be asleep?!</font>

77
00:04:48,600 --> 00:04:51,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph! I don't want to
end up getting involved!</font>

78
00:04:51,680 --> 00:04:55,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hell no...
I couldn't care less about Sasuke!</font>

79
00:04:58,610 --> 00:05:00,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ouch!</font>

80
00:05:17,040 --> 00:05:19,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What's going on...?</font>

81
00:05:19,710 --> 00:05:20,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! Behind you!</font>

82
00:05:25,420 --> 00:05:26,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">F-Fast...</font>

83
00:05:26,880 --> 00:05:28,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not just fast...</font>

84
00:05:33,060 --> 00:05:33,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guy-sensei!</font>

85
00:05:36,640 --> 00:05:38,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now, I'll announce the mission!</font>

86
00:05:38,770 --> 00:05:40,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As soon as you've heard what
the mission is, go through that hole.</font>

87
00:05:42,070 --> 00:05:44,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Track down Sasuke,
join up and then stop him!</font>

88
00:05:45,240 --> 00:05:47,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then await next orders
in a safe place.</font>

89
00:05:48,660 --> 00:05:50,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Did something happen
to Sasuke?!</font>

90
00:05:51,580 --> 00:05:52,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll tell you the reason en route!</font>

91
00:05:54,040 --> 00:05:54,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go!</font>

92
00:05:56,660 --> 00:05:58,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez... Why me?</font>

93
00:05:59,130 --> 00:06:00,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, boy!</font>

94
00:06:00,590 --> 00:06:01,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh...?</font>

95
00:06:01,590 --> 00:06:03,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If this mission is a success,</font>

96
00:06:03,710 --> 00:06:06,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">as a reward I'll let you
touch my paw-pads.</font>

97
00:06:06,970 --> 00:06:08,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So don't sulk like that!</font>

98
00:06:08,760 --> 00:06:09,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

99
00:06:09,720 --> 00:06:10,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See?</font>

100
00:06:11,600 --> 00:06:13,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're soft and supple!</font>

101
00:06:13,350 --> 00:06:15,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Su... pple...?</font>

102
00:06:15,470 --> 00:06:16,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, very...</font>

103
00:06:18,480 --> 00:06:21,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Soft and supple!</font>

104
00:06:25,610 --> 00:06:26,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's just go!</font>

105
00:06:28,990 --> 00:06:30,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-Hey!</font>

106
00:06:33,620 --> 00:06:35,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Will it be okay with just them?</font>

107
00:06:36,040 --> 00:06:39,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They'll be okay.
Pakkun is with them.</font>

108
00:06:40,330 --> 00:06:42,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As long as they don't pursue too far...</font>

109
00:07:01,560 --> 00:07:04,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think I'd be able to fight you again...</font>

110
00:07:08,990 --> 00:07:12,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This barrier can't be broken
unless it's from the inside.</font>

111
00:07:13,530 --> 00:07:17,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If Hokage-sama would just
take out one of those four,</font>

112
00:07:17,160 --> 00:07:18,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we could help...</font>

113
00:07:19,540 --> 00:07:22,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, it's gonna start soon.</font>

114
00:07:22,790 --> 00:07:25,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Put up a barrier on the inside, too!</font>

115
00:07:25,590 --> 00:07:26,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sure!</font>

116
00:07:41,100 --> 00:07:45,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hm... It doesn't look like
I'll be able to get out this easily.</font>

117
00:07:46,070 --> 00:07:48,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't really mean that.</font>

118
00:07:48,110 --> 00:07:53,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It'd be tougher for you if someone
came in and got in the way, right?</font>

119
00:08:09,800 --> 00:08:11,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art: Tile Shuriken!</font>

120
00:08:14,510 --> 00:08:15,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's too easy!</font>

121
00:08:16,850 --> 00:08:18,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Striking Shadow Snake!</font>

122
00:08:23,140 --> 00:08:25,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With such a weak technique...</font>

123
00:08:25,730 --> 00:08:29,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It sucks to get old, eh,
Sarutobi-sensei?</font>

124
00:08:37,660 --> 00:08:38,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Substitution?!</font>

125
00:08:45,290 --> 00:08:47,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Earth Style: Great Mud River!</font>

126
00:08:51,710 --> 00:08:53,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is this it?</font>

127
00:08:53,260 --> 00:08:54,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't think so!</font>

128
00:08:55,590 --> 00:08:57,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Earth Style: Earth Dragon Bomb!</font>

129
00:09:01,100 --> 00:09:02,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fire Dragon Bomb!</font>

130
00:09:08,560 --> 00:09:10,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's combined Earth and Fire!</font>

131
00:09:11,030 --> 00:09:12,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Excellent, Hokage-sama!</font>

132
00:09:20,990 --> 00:09:24,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop the stupid act, Orochimaru.</font>

133
00:09:27,630 --> 00:09:29,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Very good...</font>

134
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:35,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really, I've been grossly underestimated.</font>

135
00:09:35,760 --> 00:09:40,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did you think you could kill me
with that level of Jutsu?</font>

136
00:09:40,680 --> 00:09:44,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph... A hateful fellow as usual!</font>

137
00:09:45,230 --> 00:09:47,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't say that.</font>

138
00:09:47,900 --> 00:09:53,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A high maintenance student is cute.
Right, Sarutobi-sensei?</font>

139
00:10:07,790 --> 00:10:09,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Something's strange...</font>

140
00:10:10,130 --> 00:10:13,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All of the Academy's classes
doing self-study.</font>

141
00:10:14,510 --> 00:10:15,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And that smoke...</font>

142
00:10:17,090 --> 00:10:18,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's coming from the direction
of the exam arena.</font>

143
00:10:21,390 --> 00:10:23,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't there some disturbance
to the east?</font>

144
00:10:24,680 --> 00:10:26,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if something happened...</font>

145
00:10:28,230 --> 00:10:29,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is definitely strange!</font>

146
00:10:37,360 --> 00:10:41,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But sudden self-study is
sure a smack in the eye!</font>

147
00:10:41,410 --> 00:10:43,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's been like this for a while!</font>

148
00:10:43,450 --> 00:10:47,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah. Iruka-sensei
and everyone are late...</font>

149
00:10:47,370 --> 00:10:49,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Aren't they, Konohamaru-kun?</font>

150
00:10:57,090 --> 00:10:58,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Konohamaru-kun?</font>

151
00:10:59,260 --> 00:11:00,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yikes!</font>

152
00:11:01,220 --> 00:11:03,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez, what is this?!</font>

153
00:11:04,390 --> 00:11:07,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And Mom just bought this for me!</font>

154
00:11:08,350 --> 00:11:11,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll loan you my colored pencil.</font>

155
00:11:11,560 --> 00:11:16,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you saying?!
This color is this spring's new color!</font>

156
00:11:16,730 --> 00:11:19,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Aww, what'll I do?</font>

157
00:11:30,920 --> 00:11:31,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is...?</font>

158
00:11:36,300 --> 00:11:40,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if Naruto-kun and the others
went to stop Sasuke-kun?</font>

159
00:11:40,720 --> 00:11:41,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those brats?</font>

160
00:11:42,430 --> 00:11:46,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But surely, some Genin won't
be able to make any difference...</font>

161
00:11:49,980 --> 00:11:53,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hm? Is this the data of
that kid back there?</font>

162
00:11:55,270 --> 00:11:57,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You give him too much credit.</font>

163
00:11:58,110 --> 00:11:59,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Think again!</font>

164
00:12:00,280 --> 00:12:02,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll trip up if you underestimate him.</font>

165
00:12:29,970 --> 00:12:35,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}"Teachers' Office"</b></font>

166
00:12:31,180 --> 00:12:34,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There is information that several units
have already infiltrated the village...!</font>

167
00:12:36,060 --> 00:12:40,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We should evacuate the students
to a safe place right away!</font>

168
00:12:40,320 --> 00:12:44,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes... And without causing panic
among the students!</font>

169
00:12:45,280 --> 00:12:47,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then let's evacuate the students</font>

170
00:12:47,780 --> 00:12:49,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">as soon as possible under
the pretense of an evacuation drill!</font>

171
00:12:59,840 --> 00:13:03,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't it about time
we stopped playing around?</font>

172
00:13:03,420 --> 00:13:05,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This isn't an Academy class, so...</font>

173
00:13:07,680 --> 00:13:09,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have a point.</font>

174
00:13:13,140 --> 00:13:15,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did you foresee your final moments?</font>

175
00:13:55,230 --> 00:13:58,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't go easy on you
just because you're senile.</font>

176
00:14:00,310 --> 00:14:02,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I look forward to it.</font>

177
00:14:02,520 --> 00:14:04,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Depending on your Jutsu,</font>

178
00:14:04,440 --> 00:14:08,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I might have to have you
start over at the Academy!</font>

179
00:14:10,200 --> 00:14:12,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please don't disappoint me too much!</font>

180
00:14:26,590 --> 00:14:27,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-Wow...</font>

181
00:14:28,300 --> 00:14:29,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What Chakra?!</font>

182
00:14:30,300 --> 00:14:33,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah... It seems the air is
bearing down within the body!</font>

183
00:14:40,350 --> 00:14:42,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shuriken Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

184
00:14:48,320 --> 00:14:50,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Summoning Jutsu: Reanimation!</font>

185
00:14:51,700 --> 00:14:52,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That technique!</font>

186
00:14:53,410 --> 00:14:54,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One!</font>

187
00:14:55,620 --> 00:14:57,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He is using a Summoning Jutsu
as a shield.</font>

188
00:14:58,410 --> 00:15:00,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And this dead person is...</font>

189
00:15:00,080 --> 00:15:01,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Two!</font>

190
00:15:03,420 --> 00:15:05,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I must stop the third one at any cost...!</font>

191
00:15:05,880 --> 00:15:06,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Three!</font>

192
00:15:18,640 --> 00:15:23,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It looks like the third one was no good.
Oh well...</font>

193
00:15:27,360 --> 00:15:29,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It looks like I stopped the third one.</font>

194
00:15:30,280 --> 00:15:33,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now, this is where it gets tough...</font>

195
00:15:34,580 --> 00:15:38,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He summoned those two of all people...</font>

196
00:15:54,180 --> 00:15:56,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-It can't be!
Those personages are...!</font>

197
00:15:57,390 --> 00:15:58,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those personages are?</font>

198
00:15:59,600 --> 00:16:04,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now, what will you do,
Sarutobi-sensei...?</font>

199
00:16:04,730 --> 00:16:05,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No...</font>

200
00:16:13,320 --> 00:16:16,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Third... Hokage-sama.</font>

201
00:16:20,080 --> 00:16:23,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay! Everyone, please move quickly!</font>

202
00:16:27,630 --> 00:16:29,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, what a day!</font>

203
00:16:30,090 --> 00:16:34,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My favorite colored pencil
didn't have to break like that!</font>

204
00:16:35,050 --> 00:16:39,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lousy evacuation drill...
Self-study was better.</font>

205
00:16:40,060 --> 00:16:43,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Konohamaru-chan's been quiet, hasn't he?
I wonder what's wrong?</font>

206
00:16:44,060 --> 00:16:45,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Yeah.</font>

207
00:16:46,440 --> 00:16:49,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After the whole school does
a long self-study,</font>

208
00:16:49,270 --> 00:16:51,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the whole school does
an evacuation drill.</font>

209
00:16:52,280 --> 00:16:53,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is too strange!</font>

210
00:16:55,280 --> 00:16:57,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay! Stop! Get in line!</font>

211
00:16:58,620 --> 00:17:00,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That look on Iruka-sensei's face...</font>

212
00:17:00,830 --> 00:17:02,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Something's definitely going on here!</font>

213
00:17:04,710 --> 00:17:05,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And also...</font>

214
00:17:10,170 --> 00:17:13,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, everyone!
Don't go off on your own.</font>

215
00:17:21,970 --> 00:17:26,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That rainbow... It's been
bugging me for a while!</font>

216
00:17:32,990 --> 00:17:36,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's that, Old Man?
There's a strange rainbow!</font>

217
00:17:42,830 --> 00:17:45,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's an unusual rainbow!</font>

218
00:17:46,040 --> 00:17:48,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you like rainbows, Konohamaru?</font>

219
00:17:48,750 --> 00:17:53,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah! And I've never seen
such a pretty rainbow!</font>

220
00:17:54,260 --> 00:17:58,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see, I see.
But, Konohamaru...</font>

221
00:17:58,340 --> 00:17:59,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm?</font>

222
00:18:00,680 --> 00:18:04,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rainbows used to symbolize snakes...</font>

223
00:18:05,350 --> 00:18:09,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And it's said that they bode evil.</font>

224
00:18:09,610 --> 00:18:13,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Such a pretty thing? That's a lie!</font>

225
00:18:14,690 --> 00:18:16,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see, I see.</font>

226
00:18:23,240 --> 00:18:26,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Symbolizes snakes...
Is something happening?</font>

227
00:18:42,300 --> 00:18:45,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Long time no see... Saru.</font>

228
00:18:45,180 --> 00:18:49,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, it's you...
You've gotten old, Sarutobi.</font>

229
00:18:49,980 --> 00:18:55,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I never thought I would meet
the great brothers in this manner...</font>

230
00:18:56,780 --> 00:18:58,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's regretful.</font>

231
00:18:58,700 --> 00:18:59,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is bad.</font>

232
00:19:00,280 --> 00:19:01,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Summoning Jutsu...</font>

233
00:19:02,570 --> 00:19:04,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who in the world are they?!</font>

234
00:19:05,540 --> 00:19:07,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please prepare yourselves...</font>

235
00:19:07,790 --> 00:19:08,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First Hokage-sama...</font>

236
00:19:09,580 --> 00:19:10,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Second Hokage-sama!</font>

237
00:19:13,340 --> 00:19:14,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right...</font>

238
00:19:14,800 --> 00:19:16,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The one with the black hair
is the First Hokage.</font>

239
00:19:17,090 --> 00:19:19,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The one with the white hair
is the Second Hokage.</font>

240
00:19:20,680 --> 00:19:22,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They are both reputed to
be the highest Shinobi</font>

241
00:19:22,890 --> 00:19:25,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and they are the Hokage
who built the today's Leaf Village!</font>

242
00:19:31,810 --> 00:19:33,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Reanimation, huh?</font>

243
00:19:34,150 --> 00:19:36,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This youth summoned us with
the Forbidden Jutsu, then?</font>

244
00:19:37,530 --> 00:19:38,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's something else...</font>

245
00:19:40,860 --> 00:19:42,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, Sarutobi!</font>

246
00:19:43,320 --> 00:19:47,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Does this mean we must... fight you?</font>

247
00:19:48,410 --> 00:19:51,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's stop the old people
get-together talk...</font>

248
00:19:51,620 --> 00:19:53,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shall we get started?</font>

249
00:19:54,040 --> 00:19:56,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's always fighting...
no matter when you live.</font>

250
00:19:58,630 --> 00:20:00,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You like that, don't you?</font>

251
00:20:00,470 --> 00:20:05,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No good will come by deriding the dead
and playing around with time!</font>

252
00:20:13,810 --> 00:20:16,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I get it! So that's what happened!</font>

253
00:20:21,070 --> 00:20:23,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Sasuke, getting all impatient!</font>

254
00:20:23,450 --> 00:20:27,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, why am I pulled into this?!
This is such a drag!</font>

255
00:20:27,780 --> 00:20:31,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be helped!
It's Kakashi-sensei's order.</font>

256
00:20:34,080 --> 00:20:34,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This way!</font>

257
00:20:52,100 --> 00:20:53,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That brat, huh...</font>

258
00:20:54,730 --> 00:20:55,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go!</font>

259
00:21:05,300 --> 00:21:16,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">dare datte shippai wa surunda hazukashii koto janai</font></font></font></font>

260
00:21:05,300 --> 00:21:16,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">everyone makes mistakes it's nothing to be ashamed about</font></font></font></font>

261
00:21:16,090 --> 00:21:27,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">kono kizu o muda ni shinai de waratte arukereba ii</font></font></font></font>

262
00:21:16,090 --> 00:21:27,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">don't let this scar be for naught walk with a smile</font></font></font></font>

263
00:21:37,370 --> 00:21:42,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">sou shizuka na kuuki suikomi hiroki sora ni kao age tobikomi</font></font></font></font>

264
00:21:37,370 --> 00:21:42,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">yes, breathe in the air and lift your face to the sky and jump</font></font></font></font>

265
00:21:42,970 --> 00:21:48,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">toki ni ame ga futtara hito yasumi jaa yukusaki wa kaze fuku mama ni</font></font></font></font>

266
00:21:42,970 --> 00:21:48,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">if it rains, take a break go where the wind takes you</font></font></font></font>

267
00:21:48,170 --> 00:21:53,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">takusan no matotteru koukai kono kizu o muda ni shicha shounai</font></font></font></font>

268
00:21:48,170 --> 00:21:53,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">so many regrets don't let this scar be for naught</font></font></font></font>

269
00:21:53,380 --> 00:21:56,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">ude ni kunshou kizami ikoukai shougai</font></font></font></font>

270
00:21:53,380 --> 00:21:56,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">let's go carve the in our chest</font></font></font></font>

271
00:21:57,010 --> 00:21:58,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">sou kokkara ga SHOW TIME</font></font></font></font>

272
00:21:57,010 --> 00:21:58,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">yes, it's show time, life begins now.</font></font></font></font>

273
00:21:58,520 --> 00:22:08,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">dare datte shippai wa surunda hazukashii koto janai</font></font></font></font>

274
00:21:58,520 --> 00:22:08,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">everyone makes mistakes It's nothing to be ashamed about</font></font></font></font>

275
00:22:08,990 --> 00:22:19,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">kono kizu o muda ni shinai de waratte arukereba ii</font></font></font></font>

276
00:22:08,990 --> 00:22:19,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">don't let this scar be for naught walk with a smile</font></font></font></font>

277
00:22:19,540 --> 00:22:29,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">kanashimi mo kaze ni kaete tsuyoku susunde ikereba ii</font></font></font></font>

278
00:22:19,540 --> 00:22:29,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">transform sadness into the wind and continue to forge on</font></font></font></font>

279
00:22:29,830 --> 00:22:35,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">tsuyoku susunde ikereba ii</font></font></font></font>

280
00:22:29,830 --> 00:22:35,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">forge on strong</font></font></font></font>

281
00:22:47,670 --> 00:22:50,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Damn it! The pursuer is too fast!</font>

282
00:22:50,760 --> 00:22:54,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Once we Genin get caught,
that will be the end.</font>

283
00:22:54,310 --> 00:22:56,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">In that case,
we should ambush and attack them.</font>

284
00:22:56,600 --> 00:22:58,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I already thought of it,
but it'll probably be no use.</font>

285
